'''Kalphite guardians''' are found in the [[Kalphite Lair]] and [[Kalphite Cave]], beneath the [[Kharidian Desert]]. Both caves can be accessed through entrances south of the [[Shantay Pass]] and [[Al Kharid]], and an alternative route beyond the [[Dorgesh-Kaan Agility Course]] becomes available after completion of [[Death to the Dorgeshuun]]. A [[rope]] is required to enter the Kalphite Lair from the desert.

Kalphite guardians will inflict [[poison]] ''very'' frequently, which will apply through [[Protect from Melee]] and start at 6 damage. There are [[Ranged]] [[safespot]]s in both locations. Like all [[Kalphite (attribute)|kalphites]], they can be killed effectively with the [[keris partisan]]. They're also weak to [[crush weapons]]. In the Kalphite Cave, a [[Slayer task]] is required to kill them.

